<title>USA: Dole says Greenspan doing &quot;pretty good job&quot;.</title>
<headline>Dole says Greenspan doing &quot;pretty good job&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>DEARBORN, Michigan 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republican presidential nominee Bob Dole said on Wednesday he thinks Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspsan is &quot;cautious&quot; and is doing &quot;a pretty good job.&quot;</p>
<p>Asked by a supporter after a campaign appearance here whether or not he liked the way Greenspan has handled the Federal Reserve, Dole replied: &quot;I think pretty well, yes. He's been cautious but I think he's doing a pretty good job.&quot;</p>
</text>
